  <p id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:deng" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:deng:m0000" ref="572_278_cba_C">孫登</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:deng:m0003" ref="572_278_cba_C">子高</persName>，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:deng:m0006" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>長子也。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:lv" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:lv:m0000" ref="572_278_cba_D">孫慮</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:lv:m0003" ref="572_278_cba_D">子智</persName>，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:lv:m0006" ref="572_278_cba_C">登</persName>弟也。少敏惠有才藝，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-sundeng-sunlv-wu052:lv:m0017" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>器愛之。</p>
